Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.85,0:03:18.14,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弄了包烟 蓝电牌的 - 别臭美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pack of smokes and Brown Thunder.- Don't get cocky, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有冷饮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold drinks?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.39,0:00:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷冻机开一天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been running the freezers all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.10,0:00:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说 发电机可不是做这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the most practical use of the generators to my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也很神奇啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督觉得值就值\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Governor feels it's worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了很棒的派对干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, to a great party.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.74,0:00:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,能给我透露一点今晚的好戏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you would just drop me a hint about tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.91,0:00:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有词语能完美地描述出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Mere words cannot adequatly describe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将到来的庆典\N{\fnArial\fs30}the festivities ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩妮 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penny. Penny, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 佩妮 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, easy. Penny, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是午睡时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nap time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,午睡时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nap time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.85,0:01:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩妮 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penny, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:01:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penny. Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.49,0:02:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.67,0:02:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.11,0:02:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.64,0:02:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸还爱着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy still loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.73,0:02:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.89,0:02:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.92,0:02:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.46,0:02:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.01,0:03:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.40,0:03:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还清醒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.86,0:03:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.31,0:03:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我看看婴儿 - 我们得给孩子喂点吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me see the baby. - Well, we gotta feed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.30,0:03:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有婴儿能吃的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got anything baby can eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.23,0:03:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息是她看起来很健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}The good news is she looks healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是她需要婴儿食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she needs formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.38,0:03:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然她活不了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}And soon she won't survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.81,0:04:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不会让她死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no way… Not her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.56,0:04:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能再失去任何人了 我出去一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't losing nobody else. I'm going for a run.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我掩护你 - 我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll back you up. - I'll go too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.67,0:04:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 想想我们去哪儿 贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, think where we're going. Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚刚失去他的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid just lost his mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.41,0:04:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他爸也不太正常 - 我会照看他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- His dad ain't doing so hot. - I'll look out for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.89,0:04:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩去围栏那儿 太多行尸聚集\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two get to the fence.Too many will pile up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.91,0:04:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got ourselves a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.77,0:04:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦 玛姬 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, Maggie, Vámonos.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.24,0:04:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.12,0:04:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,去大门那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.23,0:04:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 天快黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we're gonna lose the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.71,0:04:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,85街有个小杂货店\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a Piggly Wiggly on 85.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.37,0:04:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能去 婴儿区已经没东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, baby section's been cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉让我多留心婴儿食品 但我一直没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori asked me to keep an eye out. I haven't had much luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有没被完全洗劫的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any place that hasn't been completely looted?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在北边看到了购物中心的标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saw signs for a shopping center just north of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.13,0:04:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 但是街上残骸太多车开不过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but there's too much debris on the road to a car to get through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能带你们一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.19,0:04:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.38,0:04:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Maggie,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经历了太多 还是我去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}after everything that you've been through, okay, I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.62,0:05:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去 为了洛莉 我必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to go. For Lori, I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.56,0:05:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.95,0:05:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 注意安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you. Be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.69,0:05:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.81,0:06:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.46,0:06:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,最开始我们只有九个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time we gathered, there was nine of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.80,0:06:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲在一间公寓 只有猪肉罐头和咸饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}holed up in an apartment with Spam and saltine crackers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.57,0:06:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们建造了一个可以称之为家的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've built a place we can call home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.81,0:06:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是由布基胶带和绳子捆绑而成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe held together with duct tape and string,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.71,0:06:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.92,0:06:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的 我引以为傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ours. I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.08,0:06:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}So today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.51,0:06:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们庆祝这来之不易的成就\N{\fnArial\fs30}we celebrate how far we've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.94,0:06:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,缅怀我们失去的同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}We remember those we've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.40,0:06:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我们自己举杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We raise a glass… to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.53,0:07:32.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小镇建设改善计划）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.43,0:07:42.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（佩妮）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.65,0:08:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,再等一段时间比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suggesting we delay a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.10,0:08:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,等不及 已经万事俱备了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't wait. Everything's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.76,0:08:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和莫尔一样喜欢派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love a party as much as the next fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.03,0:08:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我喜欢派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, I love a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.81,0:08:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是我们会消耗很多资源 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But we're using a lot of resources. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.15,0:08:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如发电机\N{\fnArial\fs30}For instance, the generators.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.53,0:08:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你喜欢派对呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you love a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.12,0:08:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 小米 求你轻松点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Milty, lighten up, for Christ's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.85,0:08:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松一下 好好玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let your hair down, man. Have some fun for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.44,0:08:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢玩 - 那就没问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I like fun. - Then there's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.38,0:08:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我无礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I might.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.07,0:08:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这周一直在做实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've been working on an experiment all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,让电力达到我需要的水平不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a challenge getting the level of power I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而今晚的派对耗电很大 - 你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And with everything going on tonight… - What are you asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,推迟今晚的派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Postpone tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.14,0:08:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.32,0:08:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会 让他说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. Let's hear him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.57,0:08:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你需要多久 - 不需要太长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long do you need? - I don't need long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多久 - 十天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long? - 10 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.91,0:09:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 六天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Six?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.30,0:09:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - How about…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.72,0:09:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚你好好放松一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you enjoy yourself tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.63,0:09:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早接着实验 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then begin the experiment over in the morning, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.55,0:09:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah. That could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.16,0:11:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很乐在其中是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get off on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.28,0:11:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在别人的地方随便乱闯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poking around other people's things?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.61,0:11:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没隐瞒什么事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got nothing to hide here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.65,0:11:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没隐瞒事情的人 通常不会自卖自夸\N{\fnArial\fs30}People who had noting to hide don't usually feel the need to say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.42,0:11:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.75,0:11:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都有自己的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have our secrets, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.99,0:11:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如佩妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.27,0:11:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道佩妮的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know about Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.98,0:12:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你应该知道我很爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you know I loved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.83,0:12:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说你对所有女人都这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet you say that about all the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你误会我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the wrong idea about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不过是一个希望为我在乎的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a guy trying to do right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,做对的事情的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the people I care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.90,0:12:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想离开 安德莉亚想留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you want to leave, Andrea wants to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你想逼我做出选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you want me to take choice out of the equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.30,0:12:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,想逼我把你赶出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to kick you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.43,0:12:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我本打算把刀还你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I was about to give your sword back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为你会喜欢这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess you fit in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.72,0:12:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相处得本来很愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've enjoyed having you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.63,0:13:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说 这真的很棘手\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a real problem for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家遵守规则 不管规则是真是假\N{\fnArial\fs30}People follow the rules. And whether or not it's true,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都相信这样能够保他们活命\N{\fnArial\fs30}they believe it's what keeps them alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.30,0:13:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你违反了规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}You turned that upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.03,0:13:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏了规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've broken the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.20,0:13:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不闻不问 就会造成混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I don't do anything, I invite anarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.41,0:13:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不把你今天的失态告诉大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep a lid on your little outburst,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.56,0:13:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要加入科研小队\N{\fnArial\fs30}you join the research team.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.77,0:13:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一身技能 而且不怕行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You obviously have skills and you're not afraid of biters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.20,0:13:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔会照顾你和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle will take care of you and…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.20,0:14:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很有个性\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's all personality, that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.70,0:14:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们有麻烦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.99,0:14:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.26,0:14:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫安德莉亚过来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send Andrea over to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.95,0:14:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带科研小队去填补一下库存\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take the research team to get more grist for the mill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.41,0:14:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会处理好这事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.44,0:14:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.47,0:15:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,周围怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the perimeter look?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.49,0:15:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸都散开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got the walkers spread out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.94,0:15:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need help?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.18,0:15:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友们 他们都是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends, they… they were good folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是我家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.39,0:15:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一辈子就只有一个这样的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I had one friend like that my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却有一群\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a whole group.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.59,0:15:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对他们的死很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry you lost them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.69,0:15:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,再挖两个坑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need two more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.63,0:16:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞克呢 - 还在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rick? - Still inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.81,0:16:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等会去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'll get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.48,0:16:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一天之内我们失去了三分之一的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A third of our group in one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.55,0:16:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为一个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause of one asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.23,0:16:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时我觉得一开始把犯人杀光就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of me wishes that we killed all the prisoners on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.78,0:16:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿克塞尔和奥斯卡看起来像是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Axel and Oscar seem like good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.70,0:16:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤离刚开始的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the evacuations started,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,T仔开着教堂的车去他认识的每个老人家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-Dog drove his church van to the home of every senior he knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.71,0:16:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他们需不需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}just in case they needed a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.07,0:16:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他救了我很多次\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved my ass a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.92,0:16:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不只是好人 他是最好的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't just a good guy, he was the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.44,0:17:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是关门时被咬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got bit closing the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.36,0:17:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他不关门的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he hadn't done that…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.74,0:17:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭殃的有可能是玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could have been Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.13,0:17:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这不对 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's wrong, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.36,0:17:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我随时都愿意用别人的性命换我们人的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will trade any number of people for one of us any day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.17,0:17:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 莫尔说事情很紧急\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong? Merle said it was urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.13,0:17:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是米琼恩 - 她怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Michonne. - What about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.84,0:17:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不请自入 偷走了武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}She broke in, stole her weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.79,0:17:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走自己的东西可不算偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't steal something that's hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.89,0:17:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后她又闯进了私人领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then she went into a private place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.84,0:17:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠杀了半打关押的行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and slaughtered half a dozen captive biters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.83,0:17:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要关押行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you have captive biters?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自有道理 但现在不想纠缠这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a good reason I don't want go in through right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.16,0:17:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.00,0:17:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键是 我想跟她好好谈一谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point is, I tried to talk to her about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:18:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果她用剑指着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she pulled her sword on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.54,0:18:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就指在我脖子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Held it to my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢相信你也会感到惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't imagine that surprises you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.03,0:18:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非她受到威胁 否则决不会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't do that unless she felt threatened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.98,0:18:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她让大家感到很不自在\N{\fnArial\fs30}She makes people uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.31,0:18:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想要她离开 但我不想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people want her to leave and I don't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.14,0:18:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面的情况正变得越来越糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ugly out there and it's getting rse every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是她逼得我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she put my back against the wall here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.86,0:18:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是外面那一套在这里行不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying what works out there doesn't work in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.78,0:18:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不是什么野蛮人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we're not barbarians.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.75,0:18:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得谈谈 - 我们得离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got to talk. - We got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.85,0:18:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督刚刚告诉了我发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Governor told me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.28,0:18:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,米琼恩 你必须要收敛一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne, you can't do things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.81,0:18:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会吓着别人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You freaking people out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.74,0:18:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都吓着我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.82,0:18:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,负责东北边防御的是几个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The northeast wall is guarded by some girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以在天黑后溜出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can escape there after dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.87,0:18:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里不是囚犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not prisoners here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.15,0:18:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的人只有进 没有出\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one who comes here leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.67,0:18:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.31,0:18:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.42,0:19:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有食物 有住处\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is food, there is shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有很多活人 看在上帝的份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's people, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.59,0:19:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是他们给你看的表象\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what they show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.71,0:19:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他们赶你走 你就无法自由离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't leave unless they make you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.20,0:19:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是大脑进水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.79,0:19:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,米琼恩 你需要休息一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mich, maybe you need to sit for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.81,0:19:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须要相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你必须给我个更好的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mich, maybe you need to give me more to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.61,0:19:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有我们想要的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a good thing going here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.36,0:19:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们只是暂避\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought this was temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得应该长住\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think we need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.42,0:19:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要想办法适应这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to give this place a real shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.20,0:19:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我努力过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.33,0:19:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,闯进别人的家也能算努力吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breaking into houses? That is not trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.76,0:19:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是蓄意捣乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is sabotaging.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.03,0:19:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方根本不像他们所说的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is not what they say it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.02,0:20:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.45,0:20:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都很担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.80,0:20:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.45,0:20:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.97,0:20:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.67,0:20:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必自己承担这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this all by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.75,0:20:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.13,0:20:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的牢区已经清理干净了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our cell block is cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.99,0:20:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需要把所有的门都再关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just close off all the doors again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.07,0:20:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 跟我离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick we want you just come on with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.15,0:20:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.25,0:20:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.82,0:21:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah… yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.65,0:21:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.11,0:22:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.19,0:22:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,又逮到行尸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got us a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.80,0:22:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有不少啊 把它们拉起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we got us some. Let's hook them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.21,0:22:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.76,0:22:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们抓到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ho, whoa! Look what we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.66,0:22:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 咬我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Come get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.10,0:22:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来咬啊 真厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come get it. Whoa! Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.00,0:22:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这只 这只还太小\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this one. It's too little.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.54,0:22:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 得杀了这只 - 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're gonna have to kill it. - Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.11,0:22:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,它眼睛好像不太对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something interesing in its eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.78,0:22:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不杀它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So don't kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.27,0:22:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀不杀都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a maybe for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.41,0:22:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.35,0:22:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也动一次手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hands dirty for once, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.61,0:22:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Come on. Come on down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.15,0:22:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它们弄下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.83,0:22:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,上吧 小米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Milty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.66,0:23:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉它 小子 干掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her, boy! Get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.17,0:23:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.64,0:23:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Oh, man! I tell you what,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.31,0:23:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那外套还真不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take back anything I said about that jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.62,0:23:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这儿 对着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Let me see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.46,0:23:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.18,0:23:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔 看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle, check this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.28,0:23:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,它快和你一样丑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's almost as ugly as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.83,0:23:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我勒个去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.84,0:23:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 它是个坏脾气 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! He's a mean one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.82,0:23:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看它啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.05,0:23:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 现在把它弄倒 来吧 弄倒它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, now get him down now. Come on, get him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.87,0:23:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它弄倒 你好哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him down. Yeow!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.72,0:23:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 张嘴 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy now. Open up, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.52,0:23:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬到了 好嘞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got him! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.04,0:23:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.44,0:23:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我胡来 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give me no shit, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.82,0:23:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.98,0:23:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸离得不远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Company's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.12,0:23:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.93,0:25:02.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（索菲）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.70,0:26:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚餐有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.27,0:26:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不把那个放我包里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not putting that in my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.92,0:26:33.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（婴儿奶粉）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.66,0:26:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 喂 姑娘们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.14,0:26:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们匆匆忙忙的这是去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where y'all off to in such a hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.80,0:27:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on, now. Come on. Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.47,0:27:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩就这么离开 多伤我心啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all are breaking my heart running away like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.08,0:27:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.94,0:27:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,快到宵禁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost curfew.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.88,0:27:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得派个人护送\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have to arrange an escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.32,0:27:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 派对还没完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the party's still going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.87,0:27:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.87,0:27:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.91,0:27:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,布朗尼 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brownie! Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.40,0:27:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen up, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.90,0:27:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督曾跟我们说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Governor told us we were free.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.11,0:27:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们随时都来去自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}to come and go whenever we liked.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.87,0:27:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 这不是针对谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart, nothing personal here,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.71,0:27:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你得退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're gonna have to step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.46,0:27:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.82,0:27:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们总是用各种借口留下我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always a reason why we can't leave yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.14,0:28:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.85,0:28:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是你们 我会在天黑前找个藏身处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now if I was y'all, I'd find some shelter before nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.56,0:28:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道我们要走 这都是在演戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}They knew we were coming. This was all for show.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.10,0:28:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你越说越夸张了 这只是你的猜测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear yourself? How can you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.90,0:28:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有何必要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why would they bother?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.51,0:28:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.82,0:28:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把门关上 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Close the gates. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.46,0:28:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是求着总督把你留下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I practically begged the Governor to let you stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.39,0:28:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可没这要求 - 你不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't ask for that. - You didn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.55,0:28:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友间要互相帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what friends do for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.33,0:28:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是在帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It goes both ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.50,0:28:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是想在外面用铁链拴着行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you want to run around out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.96,0:28:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠吃树枝到处逃亡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with walkers on chains eating twigs?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.11,0:28:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是说 那样就好吗 - 我们能靠自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, is… is that right? - We held our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.36,0:28:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,八个月 八个月来我们在路上四处奔波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight months! Eight months on the road moving place to place,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.90,0:28:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠拾荒糊口 以冷藏室为家\N{\fnArial\fs30}scavenging, living in a meat locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.39,0:28:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was no life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.33,0:28:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我累了 我很累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired. I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.71,0:29:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没法像那样再活八个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have another eight months in me. Not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.90,0:29:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.51,0:29:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.84,0:29:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕你会从此消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afriaid you are gonna disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.07,0:29:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前总是说这样的地方 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We always talked about this place, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.53,0:29:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}A refuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.16,0:29:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种念头支撑着我们一路前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That idea is what kept us going.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.77,0:29:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是走还是不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you coming or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.38,0:29:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.25,0:29:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别给我下最后通牒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give me an ultimatum.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.10,0:29:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起经历了那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not after everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.21,0:29:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是走 还是不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you coming or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.55,0:29:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正你也是拖我后腿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd just slow me down anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.08,0:29:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.01,0:30:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾你朋友还是走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry things didn't work out with your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.26,0:30:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人主动离开你 这感觉很怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird to lose someone by their own choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.39,0:30:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为那样的日子已经过去了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought those days had gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.56,0:30:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不确定这是否会让你感觉好些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sure this will make you feel better,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.89,0:30:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我肯定你应该喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm sure you could use a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.08,0:30:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人陪陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some company.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.91,0:31:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,做点别的事 别去想它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something to take your mind off of it for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.13,0:31:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.86,0:31:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 他们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, they are back!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.40,0:31:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 来啊 来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.54,0:31:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想吃东西吗 来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want something to eat? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.12,0:31:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.66,0:31:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.40,0:31:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.17,0:31:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.90,0:32:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝吧 喝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.77,0:32:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,给她取名字了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got a name yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.61,0:32:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.87,0:32:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想可以叫她索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was thinking maybe Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.20,0:32:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there's Carol, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.31,0:32:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.04,0:32:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.75,0:32:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.66,0:32:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰奎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.64,0:32:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕特里夏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patricia.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.97,0:32:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者洛莉 我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or… Lori. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.26,0:33:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢喝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.27,0:33:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小拽女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little ass-kicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.54,0:33:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧 这个名字不错 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right? That's a good name, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.58,0:33:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,小拽女 你也喜欢 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little ass-kicker. You like that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.12,0:33:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢吗 小甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like that, sweetheart?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.35,0:35:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give… my… wife…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.91,0:36:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you? Come on up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.00,0:36:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.83,0:36:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有全场最棒座位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the best seats in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.36,0:36:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.95,0:36:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,开心点嘛 真是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a barrel. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.63,0:36:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 够吵的啊 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a little loud. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.06,0:36:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加油啊 - 我感觉不太…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - I don't feel…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.20,0:36:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.24,0:37:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle! Merle! Merle!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.94,0:37:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merle! Merle! Merle!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.74,0:37:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一只手就能把他摆平\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kick his ass one-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.94,0:37:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼去吧 我不用手也能摆平\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell with it. No-handed!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.80,0:37:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.48,0:37:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 好戏开始啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's get it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.65,0:38:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.61,0:38:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 起来 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get up. Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.67,0:38:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就会那么点儿功夫 乡亲们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got nothing. Nothing, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.55,0:38:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 起来 - 来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get up. - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.66,0:38:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.88,0:38:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别啊 让他们继续打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let 'em fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.97,0:38:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧小子 我们好好玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, pretty boy. Let's dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.72,0:38:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.88,0:38:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.12,0:39:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,发泄消遣嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a way to blow off steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.15,0:39:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,消遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blow off steam?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.45,0:39:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢跑才叫消遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go for a jog to blow off steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.99,0:39:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这… 这叫变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is… this is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.38,0:39:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看周围 大家都很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around. Everyone's having a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.45,0:39:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,野蛮人才喜欢这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's barbaric.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.65,0:39:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是事先编排好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's staged.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.24,0:39:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们拔掉了行尸的牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we pull out the biter's teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.67,0:39:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是场表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just all for show.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.04,0:39:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.98,0:39:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就因为这才留下行尸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your reason for keeping walkers around?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.80,0:39:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们需要娱乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}People need entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.88,0:39:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就建了个角斗场吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So your solution is gladiator fights?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.97,0:39:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们被削弱了 它们在我们控制中\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're reducing these things. We're controlling them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.30,0:39:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们驱除了人们心中的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're shining a light on the monster under the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.20,0:39:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.02,0:39:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看完表演大家会更舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes people feel better about the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.89,0:39:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直是个灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a slippery slope.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.29,0:39:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在教大家行尸并不危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're teaching them that walkers aren't dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.34,0:39:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是在教大家不用害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're teaching them not to be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.57,0:39:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊小样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.79,0:40:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 不就点小伤嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Walk it off, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.47,0:40:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uno!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.74,0:40:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dos!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.97,0:40:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三 - 好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tres! - Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.33,0:42:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
